{"title":"Despacito","artist":"Luis Fonsi","sourceId":"reference:8wH35D3vKHJpN9yBrDOY","sourceHash":"90edde6e07104d3c16ec34fa18a01c5aa70ad71cbe0bce3adc94977210e97b66","performanceStatus":"reference_timing","timingMethod":"reference_lrc_unverified","reviewStatus":"draft","cue_timing_confirmed":false,"timingWarning":"(주의) 노래와 함께 타이밍 검증되지 않았음","referenceProvider":"LRCLIB","referenceId":36856755,"cues":[{"id":"1","start":6.92,"end":10.99,"text":"Ay, ¡Fonsi! ¡D.Y.","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"2","start":10.99,"end":15.03,"text":"Ohhh, oh, no, oh, no, oh","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"3","start":15.03,"end":17.75,"text":"¡Hey, yeah","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"4","start":17.75,"end":19.64,"text":"Dididiri Daddy, go","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"5","start":19.64,"end":24.98,"text":"Sí, sabes que ya llevo un rato mirándote","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"6","start":24.98,"end":28.83,"text":"Tengo que bailar contigo hoy","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"7","start":28.83,"end":35.22,"text":"(¡D.Y.!) Vi que tu mirada ya estaba llamándome","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"8","start":35.22,"end":40.14,"text":"Muéstrame el camino que yo voy","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"9","start":40.14,"end":41.2,"text":"¡Oh","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"10","start":41.2,"end":44.38,"text":"Tú, tú eres el imán y yo soy el metal","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"11","start":44.38,"end":47.37,"text":"Me voy acercando y voy armando el plan","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"12","start":47.37,"end":52.22,"text":"Sólo con pensarlo se acelera el pulso (¡Oh, yeah!)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"13","start":52.22,"end":55.33,"text":"Ya, ya me está gustando más de lo normal","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"14","start":55.33,"end":58.22,"text":"Todos mis sentidos van pidiendo más","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"15","start":58.22,"end":61.51,"text":"Esto hay que tomarlo sin ningún apuro","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"16","start":61.51,"end":63.99,"text":"Despacito","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"17","start":63.99,"end":66.71,"text":"Quiero respirar tu cuello despacito","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"18","start":66.71,"end":69.43,"text":"Deja que te diga cosas al oído","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"19","start":69.43,"end":72.88,"text":"Para que te acuerdes si no estás conmigo","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"20","start":72.88,"end":74.75,"text":"Despacito","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"21","start":74.75,"end":77.62,"text":"Quiero desnudarte a besos despacito","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"22","start":77.62,"end":80.12,"text":"Firmo en las paredes de tu laberinto","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"23","start":80.12,"end":83.48,"text":"Y hacer de tu cuerpo todo un manuscrito","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"24","start":83.48,"end":85.19,"text":"(Sube, sube, sube, sube, sube)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"25","start":85.19,"end":88.8,"text":"Quiero ver bailar tu pelo, quiero ser tu ritmo (Woah, woah)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"26","start":88.8,"end":91.93,"text":"Que le enseñes a mi boca (Woah, woah)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"27","start":91.93,"end":95.66,"text":"Tus lugares favoritos (Favorito, favorito, baby)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"28","start":95.66,"end":99.06,"text":"Déjame sobrepasar tus zonas de peligro (Woah, woah)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"29","start":99.06,"end":102.09,"text":"Hasta provocar tus gritos (Woah, woah)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"30","start":102.09,"end":105.52000000000001,"text":"Y que olvides tu apellido","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"31","start":105.52000000000001,"end":108.47999999999999,"text":"Si te pido un beso, ven, dámelo, yo sé que estás pensándolo","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"32","start":108.47999999999999,"end":111.08,"text":"Llevo tiempo intentándolo, mami, esto es dando y dándolo","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"33","start":111.08,"end":113.86,"text":"Sabes que tu corazón conmigo te hace bang-bang","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"34","start":113.86,"end":116.72999999999999,"text":"Sabes que esa beba está buscando de mi bang-bang","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"35","start":116.72999999999999,"end":119.22999999999999,"text":"Ven, prueba de mi boca para ver cómo te sabe","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"36","start":119.22999999999999,"end":122.24,"text":"Quiero, quiero, quiero ver cuánto amor a ti te cabe","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"37","start":122.24,"end":124.87,"text":"Yo no tengo prisa, yo me quiero dar el viaje","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"38","start":124.87,"end":127.45,"text":"Empecemos lento, después salvaje","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"39","start":127.45,"end":129.99,"text":"Pasito a pasito, suave suavecito","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"40","start":129.99,"end":132.98,"text":"Nos vamos pegando, poquito a poquito","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"41","start":132.98,"end":135.64,"text":"Cuando tú me besas con esa destreza","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"42","start":135.64,"end":138.46,"text":"Veo que eres malicia con delicadeza","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"43","start":138.46,"end":140.8,"text":"Pasito a pasito, suave suavecito","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"44","start":140.8,"end":143.78,"text":"Nos vamos pegando, poquito a poquito","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"45","start":143.78,"end":146.39,"text":"Y es que esa belleza es un rompecabezas","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"46","start":146.39,"end":149.11,"text":"Pero pa' montarlo aquí tengo la pieza","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"47","start":149.11,"end":150.17000000000002,"text":"¡Oye","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"48","start":150.17000000000002,"end":151.6,"text":"Despacito","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"49","start":151.6,"end":154.15,"text":"Quiero respirar tu cuello despacito","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"50","start":154.15,"end":157.04,"text":"Deja que te diga cosas al oído","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"51","start":157.04,"end":160.16,"text":"Para que te acuerdes si no estás conmigo","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"52","start":160.16,"end":162.57,"text":"Despacito","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"53","start":162.57,"end":165.17000000000002,"text":"Quiero desnudarte a besos despacito","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"54","start":165.17000000000002,"end":167.84,"text":"Firmo en las paredes de tu laberinto","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"55","start":167.84,"end":171.07,"text":"Y hacer de tu cuerpo todo un manuscrito","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"56","start":171.07,"end":172.47,"text":"(Sube, sube, sube, sube, sube)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"57","start":172.47,"end":176.38,"text":"Quiero ver bailar tu pelo, quiero ser tu ritmo (Woah, woah)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"58","start":176.38,"end":179.13,"text":"Que le enseñes a mi boca (Woah, woah)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"59","start":179.13,"end":183.63,"text":"Tus lugares favoritos (Favorito, favorito, baby)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"60","start":183.63,"end":186.78,"text":"Déjame sobrepasar tus zonas de peligro (Woah, woah)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"61","start":186.78,"end":189.66,"text":"Hasta provocar tus gritos (Woah, woah)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"62","start":189.66,"end":192.32,"text":"Y que olvides tu apellido","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"63","start":192.32,"end":194.77,"text":"Despacito","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"64","start":194.77,"end":197.32,"text":"Vamo' a hacerlo en una playa en Puerto Rico","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"65","start":197.32,"end":200.26,"text":"Hasta que las olas griten \"¡Ay, Bendito!\"","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"66","start":200.26,"end":203.7,"text":"Para que mi sello se quede contigo","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"67","start":203.7,"end":204.97,"text":"¡Báilalo","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"68","start":204.97,"end":206.82999999999998,"text":"Pasito a pasito, suave suavecito","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"69","start":206.82999999999998,"end":209.66,"text":"Nos vamos pegando, poquito a poquito","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"70","start":209.66,"end":211.96,"text":"Que le enseñes a mi boca","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"71","start":211.96,"end":214.21,"text":"Tus lugares favoritos","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"72","start":214.21,"end":215.69,"text":"(Favorito, favorito, baby)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"73","start":215.69,"end":217.82999999999998,"text":"Pasito a pasito, suave suavecito","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"74","start":217.82999999999998,"end":220.22,"text":"Nos vamos pegando, poquito a poquito","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"75","start":220.22,"end":222.97,"text":"Hasta provocar tus gritos (Fonsi)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"76","start":222.97,"end":225.62,"text":"Y que olvides tu apellido (D.Y.)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"77","start":225.62,"end":227.41,"text":"Despacito","translation":"","kind":"lyric"}],"candidates":[]}